 "fleshExperimentLines": [
  "Scott sets aside time with Sweeps Week flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Scott tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Scott sets aside time with Choir Toad flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. Their tongue goes numb. Their stomach heaves. \"NOT food,\" they gasp. \"Poison.\" The Codex notes it in grim letters. You will not make this mistake twice — Scott",
  "Scott sets aside time with Dustboar flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Scott tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Ashanti sets aside time with Loud-Eyes flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Ashanti tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Ashanti sets aside time with Ugly-Eyes flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Ashanti tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Ashanti sets aside time with The Loud Stare flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Ashanti tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it."
 ],
